================================================================================================                           >>> SYMPHONY BASIC LANGUAGE GUIDE [V7] <<<                                                 32-BIT INTEGERS       |       COMPILE :c     RUN :r                       ================================================================================================ >>>[ STATEMENTS ]<<<                           | >>>[ IF / ELSE ]<<<                            LET A = 10                                     | IF A >= 5 THEN                                 PRINT A * (2 + 3)                              |   PRINT A                                      ADD A 1                                        | ELSE                                           SUB A 2                                        |   PRINT 0                                      MUL A 3                                        | ENDIF                                          DIV A 4                                        | WHILE A < 10                                   MOD A 7                                        |   ADD A 1                                      END                                            | ENDWHILE                                                                                      |                                                >>>[ ARITHMETIC EXPRESSIONS ]<<<               | >>>[ FOR / NEXT ]<<<                           * / % have priority over + -                   | FOR I = 1 TO 5                                 ( ) override operator priority                 |   PRINT I                                      Unary: -A, +A                                  | NEXT I                                         Variables: A to Z, 32-bit                      | FOR I = 10 TO 1 STEP -2                        Constants: 0 to 4294967295                     |   PRINT I                                      No floats or string PRINT                      | NEXT I                                                                                        |                                                >>>[ COMPARISONS ]<<<                          | >>>[ DO / LOOP ]<<<                            ==   !=   <   <=   >   >=                      | DO                                             IF (A + 2) * 3 > B THEN                        |   ADD A 1                                        PRINT A                                      | LOOP UNTIL A >= 10                             ENDIF                                          | DO                                             Comparisons use signed 32-bit                  |   SUB A 1                                                                                     | LOOP WHILE A > 0                                                                              |                                                >>>[ LOOP CONTROL ]<<<                         | >>>[ COMMENTS / NOTES ]<<<                     BREAK      Exit nearest loop                   | ; full-line comment only                       CONTINUE   Start next iteration                | One statement per line                         Maximum nested control blocks: 16              | END should terminate source                                                                   | DIV / MOD by 0: runtime error                                                                 |                                                >>>[ QUICK TEST ]<<<                           | >>>[ FROM VIM NORMAL MODE ]<<<                 LET A = 7                                      | :c        Compile source                       PRINT (A + 3) * 2                              | :r        Run compiled code                    END                                            | :w        Save source to SSD                  